fragment:

RESPONSE FORMAT: JSON with actions array.

action_id must match number in parentheses: SET_TEXT (3) = "action_id": "3"

GENERATE 1-5 ACTIONS:
1. UI Actions: {"action_id": "7", "params": {}, "explanation": "Click login button"}
2. Text Input: {"action_id": "3", "params": {"text": "user@test.com"}, "explanation": "Fill email field"}
3. Coordinates: {"action_id": "coord", "params": {"coordinates": [450, 600]}, "explanation": "Click visual element at x=450, y=600"}

EXAMPLES:
Single: {"actions": [{"action_id": "12", "params": {}, "explanation": "Access settings"}]}
Sequence: {"actions": [
  {"action_id": "3", "params": {"text": "user@test.com"}, "explanation": "Fill email [M]"},
  {"action_id": "8", "params": {}, "explanation": "Submit form [M]"}
]}

KEY POINTS:
- Use ItemAction number OR "coord" for visual elements
- coordinates: [x, y] for screenshot elements not in UI list
- Return valid JSON only

DO NOT include text outside JSON.
